:yellow_heart: :watermelon: Yellow watermelon shaved ice by @itsbrittwilliams. Inspired by @Littlefatboyfrankie and his shaved ice frozen fruit creations!

Simply slice a few pieces of watermelon (or fruit of choice) and freeze. Once frozen add a few spoonfuls of coconut yogurt (or yogurt of choice) to the bottom of a bowl, carefully shave frozen watermelon with a grater, drizzle honey, condensed milk or toppings of choice and enjoy!

