@jasmineandtea 

The perfect holiday treat — Christmas bark!

This sweet and colorful chocolate bark is so simple to make. Melt dark, white, and semisweet chocolate bars in a warm oven, swirl with a toothpick for a patterned effect, then sprinkle with festive toppings, like pretzels, sprinkles, and crushed peppermint candies. Chill in the fridge, break apart, and serve at your holiday party!

